    "body": "This is the same issue as https://www.owasp.org/index.php/Cross_Site_History_Manipulation_(XSHM) correct? Has any browser taken any steps to mitigate the attack?\n\nChecking the demo https://tests.reinom.com/http/xshm/ in Chrome, the malicious page thinks the cookie is set both when it is actually set and when it isn't.\n",
