    "created_at": "2016-11-08T15:35:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-08T15:35:51Z",
    "body": "Yes, it's the same issue.\nFirefox team member Benjamin Smedberg said that this is a spec issue ( https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1315203#c2 ) so Mozilla won't mitigate it if the spec remain unchanged.\n\nIt appears the XSHM occurs in Firefox (47) and IE (11). In Chrome (48), Opera (41), it doesn't. So it may be related to the way History entries are added when a 3xx redirect occurs. I'm not very sure about what the specs says in such situation, so I cannot tell which of (Firefox+IE) or (Opera+Chrome) is wrong about the spec's implementation.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
